### Create a new user (dynamic variables generate fresh values every run)
# @name CREATE_USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{$uuid}}",
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test-{{$timestamp}}@example.com"
}

### Verify the user we just created — chained from CREATE_USER's response
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{CREATE_USER.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
